      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-09",
      "edition": "Monday 9 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Galthié recalls Julien Marchand, Gaël Fickou and Louis Carbonel for Springboks test",
          "body": "Hooker Julien Marchand, sidelined since a thigh injury in early October, is back in the squad after France coach Fabien Galthié recalled him on Sunday. He returned for Toulouse on Saturday and could go straight into the starting XV. Galthié has also recalled Gaël Fickou, Teddy Thomas, Louis Carbonel and Gaël Drean, with Carbonel yet to feature in a France match 23 since 2022. Romain Ntamack's shoulder injury against Fiji has left a gap, with Matthieu Jalibert and Thomas Ramos already out."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England beat Australia 45-22 with Henry Pollock scoring twice",
          "body": "Wales: WRU formally bids for Premiership entry; URC threatens legal action. Argentina's Marcos Camerlinckx completes move to Bath Rugby."
