    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-09",
      "edition": "Monday 9 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Dan Sheehan failed head injury assessment; Robert Baloucoune also went off",
          "body": "Captain Dan Sheehan was forced off in the first half of Friday's win over Argentina after failing a head injury assessment, though Andy Farrell said he \"seems fine in the dressing room\". Robert Baloucoune also went off with a knock in the 58th minute, while Sean Jansen sustained a \"bang\" to his knee and Josh van der Flier and Mack Hansen both have ankle concerns. Hansen carried on after treatment."
        },
        {
