      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection timeline",
          "heading": "Italy to name Argentina team Thursday as Quesada fronts press conference",
          "body": "Thursday brings the Azzurri's official team announcement for Genoa, in a press release, with head coach Gonzalo Quesada also fronting a Zoom press conference that day. The Argentina match is at Stadio Ferraris, where Friday's captain's run is open to media for its first 15 minutes before the captain's own press conference. Italy then host Fiji at Udine's Bluenergy Stadium on 21 November."
        },
        {
